# NOTE TO MAINTAINERS: this file is never copied into a consumer project
# verbatim — see setup/gitignore.fragment's header for how init_harness.py
# processes fragment files. The whole content below is gated on
# LATEX_DRAFTING_ENABLED: the LaTeX/Beamer drafting suite is the only source
# of large generated PDFs that warrant git-LFS, so a project with the suite
# off gets no .gitattributes content (and no file at all).
# ---FRAGMENT CONTENT BELOW---

# GATE:latex:start
docs/theory/**/*.pdf filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
docs/report/**/*.pdf filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# GATE:latex:end
